ならその考えは一旦経由してそうで\n（ちゃんと理由がわかってるわけではない）","ts":"1617714181.422600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DYyH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56aa8a29-a035-4753-85ac-9f2a8aa74a4d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"逆に exact match を全部やめれば、とも思ったんですけど","ts":"1617714144.421900","thread_ts":"1617713488.414900","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yeQ"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"380e3b4a-a10e-41c2-a5c1-8e62c2d19bf0","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`type MyInt` が exact matchなので `type int` も exact matchにする\n代わりに `type ~int` を導入するってことか","ts":"1617713488.414900","thread_ts":"1617713488.414900","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mNjwI"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"5917f0ac-bacd-420d-b09a-92354736dd66","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"辛いっしゅ","ts":"1617714056.421700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H8wb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85e031fb-10c4-42f7-ac93-0412fedfc1e1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`-ish` を suffix としてつけるという辛い案を思いついた\n\n`type interface { int-ish | int8-ish }`","ts":"1617714014.421500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/zv5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2f320f6-3cd7-4dac-a13c-ccdbdf7a6d29","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"記号じゃなくて `like` とか使えないのとかあるけど構文はまあ後で検討すればよろしい\n機能としては多分必要そう","ts":"1617713972.420800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sx2pA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dc0b820-837f-425e-9959-1a0acd16e2d5","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なんやかんやで `~` 要る気がしてきたなあ","ts":"1617713944.420000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"blR3n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ff6e5f1-3214-485e-afc9-64fecef94f76","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"そうだと思いました","ts":"1617713880.419600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pTYcl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51b5f7d3-f802-4700-8f25-ed135a9d6030","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"type hoge interface { error } はinterfaceの埋め込み扱いか","ts":"1617713843.419200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8dE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d60a782-02af-4995-a120-05c08f4ac2c8","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"os package に error が定義されていた時代 (0.x)","ts":"1617713784.418800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jtPWk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bdcec41-eb13-466b-a8d0-3e09f669b3d9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"error は interface の一種なんでは?","ts":"1617713767.418300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0cXY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"106d3d7d-1316-416c-abf7-b94193841da4","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`Most` いうてるけど `error` はどうなんだっけ、どこかに書いてあった気がする","ts":"1617713752.417900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"upV/H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f207277-4367-4832-92fc-1e8d5b421dee","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"NVM","ts":"1617713730.417400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ti/6C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7f92dce-ec4f-4f1f-80a4-8147294a966d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"はい","ts":"1617713727.417000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qr3Z="}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e46b068-2353-4b9d-9c1b-29b0ee991b7a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なんでもないでーす","ts":"1617713721.416700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ft6kj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a37f591-b960-4648-ba17-3bd13235309c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ああ、いいのか","ts":"1617713716.416400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oHI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69b5d78f-7c6e-4451-a7e7-4094e08fe69a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; Since `~T` means the set of all types whose underlying type is `T`, it\n\u0026gt; will be an error to use `~T` with a type `T` whose underlying type is\n\u0026gt; not itself.\n\u0026gt; Types whose underlying types are themselves are:\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; 1. Type literals, such as `[]byte` or `struct{ f int }`.\n\u0026gt; 2. Most predeclared types, such as `int` or `string`.\n\u0026gt; 3. Type parameters (but [see below](#Type-sets-of-embedded-parameters)).\nこれの 2 がよくわからなかった","ts":"1617713627.416000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7025"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d9e2961-7d05-4f57-ae71-946678da1c2f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"consitency","ts":"1617713512.415600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7y2n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9bc419a-94e8-4092-b828-5cdb85a34c0f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど","ts":"1617713509.415300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"diYC7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"380e3b4a-a10e-41c2-a5c1-8e62c2d19bf0","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`type MyInt` が exact matchなので `type int` も exact matchにする\n代わりに `type ~int` を導入するってことか","ts":"1617713488.414900","thread_ts":"1617713488.414900","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mNjwI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b9a4dc1-8fd0-4690-966a-91bae4f301fd","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"(by iant)","ts":"1617713370.414100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZZC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75c44705-f0dc-41a4-82c1-8cdf897d8e9a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なるほどね","ts":"1617713357.413600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ny2k/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8871a66c-d563-4d7a-a717-e0130cd17742","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u0026gt;  I think that in effect we have already tried it. In the currently published proposal, not including this proposal, type lists do not use ~. Instead, matching is done on underlying types. But this means that there is a subtle difference between type int and type MyInt, which can be confusing. This proposal aims to eliminate that subtle difference.","ts":"1617713354.413400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d4BTe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"969ddfff-12cc-49ad-85ee-2cac6acf67f4","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"思いつかないですね…","ts":"1617712088.412300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"omp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"711844db-0153-45df-a516-2c1fcc3e6aa5","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あるのかな","ts":"1617712043.412100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OZKs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a25124d8-eb53-445e-88c1-e093bc8242d7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"例えば `type Foo struct{ ... }` みたいなのがあったときに `Foo` は許すが `~Foo` は想定していない、というのはありそう","ts":"1617712033.411900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mV0yR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"965fb723-5b82-4faa-a674-a7fa582ede98","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://go-review.googlesource.com/c/proposal/+/306689/3/design/43651-type-parameters.md\u003e","ts":"1617711969.411200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Gerrit Code Review","id":1,"text":"Gerrit Code Review","blocks":null,"service_name":"go-review.googlesource.com","service_icon":"https://go-review.googlesource.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://go-review.googlesource.com/c/proposal/+/306689/3/design/43651-type-parameters.md","original_url":"https://go-review.googlesource.com/c/proposal/+/306689/3/design/43651-type-parameters.md"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j0s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95bb7224-259c-4925-899b-c8cb08525664","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"（初見のときは明示されるのええやん！って思ってたけど）","ts":"1617711949.411000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kP/+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"403df7a5-4d06-451a-b17a-bc1a6c0702f6","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ただunderlying typeって今までよしなにやるで上手く行ってきたのでここで明示しなくていいのかなあくらいの感想でした","ts":"1617711918.410600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xCnyF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e816ed5-9aa9-48b2-9e29-ca577a204604","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なくはない…","ts":"1617711895.410000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q8D/3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d2dd0b0-7eaa-4da5-b5f2-0a8d7b7c198a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"明示的に ~ 必須にするのはありかなあ","ts":"1617711870.409600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yw+9U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e0edf1d-a037-4bff-8b6b-4440e8016f9b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"でも結局敢えて `~` つけないケースは思いつかないのだ